        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Georgie Collins\n- Works: Ghostkeeper, Lonesome Dove: The Series\n- Concepts: Windigo legend, Wendigo psychosis\n- Places: North America\n\nFacts:\n- The plot of the film Ghostkeeper is inspired by the Windigo legend of North America.\n- Wendigo psychosis is a controversial modern medical term named after the Wendigo legend.\n- Psychiatrists have described Wendigo psychosis as a culture-bound syndrome with symptoms including an intense craving for human flesh and a fear of becoming a cannibal.\n- Georgie Collins is known for her role in the 1981 cult horror film Ghostkeeper.\n- Georgie Collins also appeared in Lonesome Dove: The Series in 1995.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
      {
